# Ship the prebuilt dashboard so the no-Node git deploy (install.sh / update.sh) serves it.
# The Flask web service serves this dist/ via pm25/api.py `_web_root()`. Build with
# `npm run build` on a dev machine or in CI, then commit the refreshed dist/.
# node_modules and other build junk stay ignored via aqi-worker/.gitignore and the repo root.
!dist/
!dist/**
